MintCurveConvexPosition::claimRewards()
├── given caller is not owner and not authorized spender
│   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionUnauthorized
└── given caller is owner or authorized spender
    ├── when caller is authorized spender and not owner
    │   └── it should succeed and transfer rewards to owner
    ├── it should claim rewards from the configured Convex reward pool
    ├── it should transfer the full CRV and CVX balances held by the position to owner
    └── it should emit ClaimRewards with the transferred CRV and CVX amounts
